OL,3,APalestinian families displaced as
OL,4,AIsraeli forces demolish Hebron homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Israeli military has launched a
OL,7,Fsweeping crackdown in the occupied West
OL,8,FBank, demolishing homes and businesses
OL,9,Fin the city of Hebron and displacing
OL,10,Fhundreds of families, according to
OL,11,Flocal officials.
OL,13,FFootage shared online showed
OL,14,Fdestruction caused by Israeli
OL,15,Fbulldozers, with at least one whole
OL,16,Fstreet appearing to have been
OL,17,Fflattened. The military has also
OL,18,Fcordoned off the city, heavily
OL,19,Frestricting the movement of its 200,000
OL,20,Fresidents.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
