OL,3,AMan arrested after fire at Hitler's
OL,4,Amountaintop Eagle's Nest retreat
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 200 emergency personnel were
OL,7,Fdeployed to the scene where the blaze
OL,8,Fwas still burning early on Saturday, as
OL,9,Fpolice said difficult terrain hindered
OL,10,Fefforts to bring the fire under
OL,11,Fcontrol.
OL,13,FPolice said they apprehended the
OL,14,Fsuspect riding a motorcycle near the
OL,15,Fscene and possible motives were still
OL,16,Fbeing examined, German media reported.
OL,17,FA criminal investigation has been
OL,18,Flaunched.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
